{"supplier":"hotelbeds","supplierHotelId":"945828","name":"The Ruck Hotel","description":"Take in the views from a garden and make use of amenities such as complimentary wireless internet access and a banquet hall. Enjoy a satisfying meal at L'Atelier du Ruck serving guests of The Ruck Hotel. Wrap up your day with a drink at the bar/lounge. Buffet breakfasts are available daily from 6:30 AM to 11:00 AM for a fee. Featured amenities include complimentary newspapers in the lobby, a 24-hour front desk, and luggage storage. This hotel has 5 meeting rooms available for events. Self parking (subject to charges) is available onsite. Stay in one of 134 guestrooms featuring flat-screen televisions. Complimentary wireless internet access keeps you connected, and satellite programming is available for your entertainment. Conveniences include phones, as well as laptop-compatible safes and desks. Distances are displayed to the nearest 0. 1 mile and kilometer. Gerland Sports Palace - 0. 4 km / 0. 2 mi- École Normale Superieure de Lyon - 0. 4 km / 0. 2 mi- Matmut Stadium - 0. 4 km / 0.","address":"345 Av. Jean Jaurès","city":"LYON","countryCode":"FR","postalCode":"69007","lat":45.736279,"lng":4.836569,"stars":4,"giataCode":"1366413","phone":"+33428386900","email":"welcome@theruckhotel.com","images":[{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/94/945828/945828a_hb_a_001_20250609_012956.jpg?20250609032956","category":"exterior","order":0},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/94/945828/945828a_hb_a_002_20250609_012957.jpg?20250609032957","category":"exterior","order":1},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/94/945828/945828a_hb_a_003_20250609_013006.jpg?20250609033006","category":"exterior","order":2},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/94/945828/945828a_hb_a_004_20250609_013009.jpg?20250609033009","category":"exterior","order":3},{"url":"https://photos.hotelbeds.com/giata/bigger/94/945828/945828a_hb_a_005_20250609_013012.jpg?2025060903301